,\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Offline Support",\n      "description": "App works with intermittent internet and provides some offline functionality.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Localization",\n      "description": "Multi-language support, with optional RTL layout for supported languages.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#2D9CDB",\n    "secondary": "#27AE60",\n    "accent": "#F2C94C"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app features a minimal, mobile-first layout: onboarding screens for registration and KYC, a home dashboard showing total savings and quick actions, a dedicated savings goals screen with progress bars, a withdrawal request screen with emergency reason input, and a settings/account screen for security and language preferences. Large buttons, accessible fonts, and colorful, encouraging visuals are used throughout."\n}'}",
